        "slc_d13afdd823439521dba68886d1b82f62d38bde2efa0a05d2040dd28587f68f19"
      ],
      "text": "Documentation states models and keys are handled by Simon Willison's llm library, chosen over LiteLLM, PydanticAI, and a raw OpenAI SDK/OpenRouter combination for its multi-provider plugin model, per-conversation session state, and plain-function tool calling."
    },
