        "slc_c724a52cd8dd5c635d3a33c4dda0bc5845848e36adee5693d57c4413cb158269"
      ],
      "text": "Documentation states planting creates a fresh, private git repo at the target directory (or nests git under self/ inside an existing repo) and never overwrites an existing seed.py or run_seed.sh, so a grown loop cannot be clobbered by a later plant."
    },
