        "slc_c1c27a332feb29a2f4b212b2e332bb267ab100a5c9a45bf1506af08b1702c126"
      ],
      "text": "The design document frames its distinct claim as germinating a personal agent from an auditable seed in dialogue, with conversation as selection pressure rather than a benchmark-driven optimization loop."
    },
